cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GTAgentClinic or its cases, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GTAgentClinic: a 3D embodied hospital environment for AI and human agents"
abstract: >-
  An open, embodied 3D hospital where AI agents and humans take histories,
  examine, order and read tests, call consultants and are scored like an OSCE.
  It starts with the emergency department. Humans and agents share one action
  space. The simulation is seeded; LLM replies can vary.
